{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lurking in fear has been a passion project of my own for the last few year, It is a game developed by a solo dev, Its all about enjoying the love of zombie games but without the feeling of being locked down by a story mode. JUST GO WHERE EVER YOU WANT!<br><br>Enjoy going to any towns or building you want when ever you want, Loot as much as you would like, and if you are getting tired of the open world style playing, just try out the Round based\u00a0 Zombies version!! Altho still W.I.P You can still have plenty of fun!<br><br>Round based Zombies does have a Upgrade Machine for all of your useable weapons, unlockable doors to different areas of the maps, and all around fun just grinding and seeing how far you can get!!!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916010?t=1755027110","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916010/b45bb05408dda7c7c85076bd7b5d59cecdaa1f0f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755027110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916010/f05ec9b640fae1478894c0505e6b5290390fad68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755027110","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916010/f05ec9b640fae1478894c0505e6b5290390fad68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755027110","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Violents, Blood and gore will be visible in this game. Use of weapons against enemies can and will cause violent blood and death."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lurking in fear has been a passion project of my own for the last few year, It is a game developed by a solo dev, Its all about enjoying the love of zombie games but without the feeling of being locked down by a story mode. JUST GO WHERE EVER YOU WANT!<br><br>Enjoy going to any towns or building you want when ever you want, Loot as much as you would like, and if you are getting tired of the open world style playing, just try out the Round based\u00a0 Zombies version!! Altho still W.I.P You can still have plenty of fun!<br><br>Round based Zombies does have a Upgrade Machine for all of your useable weapons, unlockable doors to different areas of the maps, and all around fun just grinding and seeing how far you can get!!!</p>","developers":["DlyansUE5"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916010/d98974aba17dd535320f4f159f7a9060429fa916/header.jpg?t=1755027110","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916010/1707731939/58d1e132acdd9e6b3c09b0b6f78bc7bacc56e3b5/1754121463/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755027109","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916010/1707731939/58d1e132acdd9e6b3c09b0b6f78bc7bacc56e3b5/1754121463/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755027109","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916010/1707731939/58d1e132acdd9e6b3c09b0b6f78bc7bacc56e3b5/1754121463/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755027109","id":257177112,"name":"Lurking In Fear Trailer!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177112/b4382a21297be9178949f3b323d773de43e92cb8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755027109"}],"name":"Lurking In Fear","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</s